  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hipotecaria V&#xE9;rtice S.A. de C.V. Sofom E.N.R. (Hipotecaria V&#xE9;rtice) is a Mexican company that finances real estate projects and residential mortgages, seeking to help increase its clients&#x2019; assets. The purpose of this IIC project is to support lending and fund the growth of the portfolio of loans to housing developers, especially those that are environmentally friendly. With this loan of 50 millon Mexican pesos, the IIC would be helping Hipotecaria V&#xE9;rtice diversify its sources of funding.</narrative>
  </description>
